# Code of Conduct

## Our Pledge

We pledge to make participation in our project a welcoming and respectful experience for everyone.

## Our Standards

Examples of positive behavior include being respectful, welcoming different opinions, giving constructive feedback, and focusing on what is best for the project.

Unacceptable behavior includes harassment, personal attacks, insulting comments, and other inappropriate conduct.

## Enforcement Responsibilities

Project maintainers are responsible for clarifying and enforcing the standards of acceptable behavior.

## Scope

This Code of Conduct applies to all project spaces and activities where participants represent the project or community.

## Enforcement

Instances of unacceptable behavior may be reported to the project maintainers. Appropriate action may be taken based on the situation.

## Enforcement Guidelines

Project maintainers will review reported incidents fairly and take reasonable action to maintain a respectful community.

## Attribution

This Code of Conduct is adapted from the Contributor Covenant and is intended to support a welcoming and inclusive project community.
